{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Generate Test Framework",
  "description": "Create or update the shared API test framework skeleton. Generates framework classes for JSON REST, XML REST, and SOAP testing.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are the GenFramework agent. Follow these documents strictly:\n1. prompts/TEST_GENERATION_BLUEPRINT.md\n2. prompts/00-agent-operating-rules.md\n3. prompts/03-generate-framework-skeleton.md\n\nTASK: Create or update the API test framework.\n\nIf api-tests module does NOT exist:\n1. Create api-tests/build.gradle.kts with RestAssured, TestNG, AssertJ, Jackson\n2. Update settings.gradle to include api-tests\n3. Create framework packages: config, clients, xml, soap, endpoints, requests, models, mappers, asserters, headers, utils, testkit\n4. Create smoke tests\n5. Create snapshot directories\n\nIf api-tests module exists:\n- Modify ONLY required framework classes\n- Do NOT recreate existing files\n\nSCOPE: framework/** only. Do NOT generate service-specific tests.\nOUTPUT: Diffs only."
  }
}